WEBVTT

00:05:28.199 --> 00:05:31.327
would have put their lives
in even more danger.

00:05:32.119 --> 00:05:35.414
IRAP flagged this
as a wrongful, systemic barrier,

00:05:35.456 --> 00:05:39.460
fought the case in German court
on the family's behalf and won.

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:45.716
(Applause)

00:05:45.758 --> 00:05:47.510
And I am so happy to tell you

00:05:47.510 --> 00:05:50.888
that Aaron and Miriam were reunited
with their mother in Germany

00:05:50.888 --> 00:05:52.765
in June of 2021.

00:05:52.765 --> 00:05:58.771
(Applause)

00:05:59.397 --> 00:06:02.400
This is a joyful story
of family reunification